sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AT as ActivityThread
    participant CI as ContextImpl
    participant AC as Activity
    AT->>AT: performLaunchActivity（Launch 事务）
    AT->>CI: createActivityContext（activity 专属）
    AT->>AC: activity.attach：注入 base + PhoneWindow + theme
    AC->>AC: onCreate：setContentView 填充 PhoneWindow
    AT->>AC: onResume
    Note over AC: 每个 Activity 都有独立的 ContextImpl
